# Obsolete: AMR Firmware Tasks

Status: Obsolete as of 2026-05-09.

This file used to track early STM32 motor-control bring-up tasks. It is intentionally retained only as a pointer so old references do not imply an active task board.

Current sources of truth:

- `docs/project/AMR_project.md` for the canonical project roadmap.
- `docs/architecture/STM_architecture.md` for STM32 firmware architecture.
- `docs/hardware/pin_map.yaml` for pin assignments.
- `docs/safety/safety_fault_recovery.md` for fault decode and recovery behavior.
- `STM/STM_Firmware_AMR_v2/` for current firmware source.

Historical note:

- The old contents referenced several legacy planning docs that are not part of the current repo structure. Those references were removed during the docs reorganization.
